  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Next Time You See Me** (1 review): Named by the reviewer as a personal highlight of the night [8]\n- **Cumberland Blues** (1 review): Reviewer lists it among the highlights, saying naturally [8]\n- **Viola Lee Blues** (1 review): Reviewer enjoyed the Viola into China Cat into Rider run plus the Viola reprise [8]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Opening Jam**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [9]\n- **Dont Ease Me In**: back after 50 archived shows (374 days) [9]\n- **Women Are Smarter**: rare: 9 archived performances [9]\n- **Rhythem Devils**: rare: 4 archived performances [9]\n- **Viola Lee Blues Reprise**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [9]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **DAC2018-06-13** (recommended): audience recording; 20 songs; 160 min; rated 4/5 by 2 [1]\n- **dco2018-06-13.mgmatrix**: source not stated; 19 songs; 159 min; rated 4.67/5 by 3 [3]. Said about its sound: Reviewer calls the sound clean and the band tight [7]\n- **DC2018-06-13**: audience recording; 19 songs; 155 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer didn't attend but watched much of the show on live stream, the rest as recorded video [5]\n- Reviewer met the taper in person; the mic forest once seemed endless but is now countable on one hand [6]\n- Venue was pleasant; good tickets turned up about a week out, possibly released VIP seats [7]\n- Reviewer rates this show above the SPAC 6/11 show [7]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **DAC2018-06-13**: taped by Bill Goldberg; transferred by Bill Goldberg; source: Audience [1]. Also: Reviewer credits the AKG 568 taping crew with this audience recording; Microphones were mounted on an eight-foot stand [1][4]\n- **dco2018-06-13.mgmatrix**: taped by Keith Antaya; transferred by Keith Antaya; source: MG21(Hypers)+MG20(Cards)>nBob Actives>nBox Elite>R44(24/48) [3]. Also: Taped from official tapers section seats 601-602 in 600 JJ; SDHC card to Adobe Audition 3.0 to CDWave [3]\n- **DC2018-06-13**: taped by Taper76; transferred by Taper76; source: Audience>WAV [2]",
